# Generated bodies for walkup and two-unit apartments: gridded.toml, 2000 Citizens, --start-at 600,
# default test-street preset. Tile 107 137 is a two-unit drawn from its Blender body for comparison.
601 pause
601 ui exact-bodies on
601 ui family-bodies on
601 focus 107 137 70
601 tilt 25
601 shoot plans/evidence/appearance-families/body-two-unit-blender.png
601 speed 5
602 pause
602 focus 76 208 80
602 shoot plans/evidence/appearance-families/body-two-unit.png
602 speed 5
603 pause
603 focus 167 131 80
603 shoot plans/evidence/appearance-families/body-walkup-front.png
603 speed 5
604 pause
604 turn left
604 turn left
604 shoot plans/evidence/appearance-families/body-walkup-back.png
604 speed 5
606 quit
